{"instruction": "Generate a BPMN 2.0 diagram: a guest requests a hotel reservation; the system checks room availability; if a room is available, confirm the booking and charge the card; if not, offer alternative dates.", "ir": {"process_id": "Process_hotel", "name": "Hotel reservation", "nodes": [{"id": "start", "type": "startEvent", "name": "Reservation requested"}, {"id": "t1", "type": "serviceTask", "name": "Check room availability"}, {"id": "g1", "type": "exclusiveGateway", "name": "Room available?"}, {"id": "t2", "type": "serviceTask", "name": "Confirm booking"}, {"id": "t3", "type": "serviceTask", "name": "Charge card"}, {"id": "t4", "type": "sendTask", "name": "Offer alternative dates"}, {"id": "end", "type": "endEvent", "name": "Request handled"}], "edges": [{"source": "start", "target": "t1"}, {"source": "t1", "target": "g1"}, {"source": "g1", "target": "t2", "name": "available", "condition": "available == true"}, {"source": "g1", "target": "t4", "name": "unavailable", "condition": "available == false"}, {"source": "t2", "target": "t3"}, {"source": "t3", "target": "end"}, {"source": "t4", "target": "end"}]}, "meta": {"source": "first-party-authored-eval"}}
{"instruction": "Generate a BPMN 2.0 diagram: an IT incident is logged, its severity is triaged; if critical, escalate to the on-call engineer, otherwise add it to the standard queue; then the incident is resolved and closed.", "ir": {"process_id": "Process_incident", "name": "IT incident handling", "nodes": [{"id": "start", "type": "startEvent", "name": "Incident logged"}, {"id": "t1", "type": "userTask", "name": "Triage severity"}, {"id": "g1", "type": "exclusiveGateway", "name": "Critical?"}, {"id": "t2", "type": "sendTask", "name": "Escalate to on-call engineer"}, {"id": "t3", "type": "serviceTask", "name": "Add to standard queue"}, {"id": "g2", "type": "exclusiveGateway", "name": "Merge"}, {"id": "t4", "type": "userTask", "name": "Resolve incident"}, {"id": "end", "type": "endEvent", "name": "Incident closed"}], "edges": [{"source": "start", "target": "t1"}, {"source": "t1", "target": "g1"}, {"source": "g1", "target": "t2", "name": "critical", "condition": "severity == 'critical'"}, {"source": "g1", "target": "t3", "name": "non-critical", "condition": "severity != 'critical'"}, {"source": "t2", "target": "g2"}, {"source": "t3", "target": "g2"}, {"source": "g2", "target": "t4"}, {"source": "t4", "target": "end"}]}, "meta": {"source": "first-party-authored-eval"}}
{"instruction": "Generate a BPMN 2.0 diagram: a job applicant's CV is received and screened; if it passes screening, schedule an interview; otherwise send a rejection letter.", "ir": {"process_id": "Process_hiring", "name": "CV screening", "nodes": [{"id": "start", "type": "startEvent", "name": "CV received"}, {"id": "t1", "type": "userTask", "name": "Screen CV"}, {"id": "g1", "type": "exclusiveGateway", "name": "Passes screening?"}, {"id": "t2", "type": "userTask", "name": "Schedule interview"}, {"id": "t3", "type": "sendTask", "name": "Send rejection letter"}, {"id": "end", "type": "endEvent", "name": "Screening complete"}], "edges": [{"source": "start", "target": "t1"}, {"source": "t1", "target": "g1"}, {"source": "g1", "target": "t2", "name": "pass", "condition": "passed == true"}, {"source": "g1", "target": "t3", "name": "fail", "condition": "passed == false"}, {"source": "t2", "target": "end"}, {"source": "t3", "target": "end"}]}, "meta": {"source": "first-party-authored-eval"}}
{"instruction": "Generate a BPMN 2.0 diagram: a warranty claim is submitted, coverage is verified by a decision service; if covered, repair the product; if not covered, notify the customer that it is not covered.", "ir": {"process_id": "Process_warranty", "name": "Warranty claim", "nodes": [{"id": "start", "type": "startEvent", "name": "Claim submitted"}, {"id": "t1", "type": "businessRuleTask", "name": "Verify warranty coverage"}, {"id": "g1", "type": "exclusiveGateway", "name": "Covered?"}, {"id": "t2", "type": "userTask", "name": "Repair product"}, {"id": "t3", "type": "sendTask", "name": "Notify not covered"}, {"id": "end", "type": "endEvent", "name": "Claim resolved"}], "edges": [{"source": "start", "target": "t1"}, {"source": "t1", "target": "g1"}, {"source": "g1", "target": "t2", "name": "covered", "condition": "covered == true"}, {"source": "g1", "target": "t3", "name": "not covered", "condition": "covered == false"}, {"source": "t2", "target": "end"}, {"source": "t3", "target": "end"}]}, "meta": {"source": "first-party-authored-eval"}}
{"instruction": "Generate a BPMN 2.0 diagram: when an article is submitted, an editorial review and a legal review happen at the same time; once both complete, the article is published.", "ir": {"process_id": "Process_publish", "name": "Content publishing", "nodes": [{"id": "start", "type": "startEvent", "name": "Article submitted"}, {"id": "split", "type": "parallelGateway", "name": "Fork reviews"}, {"id": "t1", "type": "userTask", "name": "Editorial review"}, {"id": "t2", "type": "userTask", "name": "Legal review"}, {"id": "join", "type": "parallelGateway", "name": "Join reviews"}, {"id": "t3", "type": "serviceTask", "name": "Publish article"}, {"id": "end", "type": "endEvent", "name": "Article published"}], "edges": [{"source": "start", "target": "split"}, {"source": "split", "target": "t1"}, {"source": "split", "target": "t2"}, {"source": "t1", "target": "join"}, {"source": "t2", "target": "join"}, {"source": "join", "target": "t3"}, {"source": "t3", "target": "end"}]}, "meta": {"source": "first-party-authored-eval"}}
{"instruction": "Generate a BPMN 2.0 diagram: a user requests a password reset, their identity is verified, a reset link is sent, and after they set a new password the account credentials are updated.", "ir": {"process_id": "Process_pwreset", "name": "Password reset", "nodes": [{"id": "start", "type": "startEvent", "name": "Reset requested"}, {"id": "t1", "type": "serviceTask", "name": "Verify identity"}, {"id": "t2", "type": "sendTask", "name": "Send reset link"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "intermediateCatchEvent", "name": "New password submitted"}, {"id": "t3", "type": "serviceTask", "name": "Update account credentials"}, {"id": "end", "type": "endEvent", "name": "Password reset complete"}], "edges": [{"source": "start", "target": "t1"}, {"source": "t1", "target": "t2"}, {"source": "t2", "target": "e1"}, {"source": "e1", "target": "t3"}, {"source": "t3", "target": "end"}]}, "meta": {"source": "first-party-authored-eval"}}
